  "title": "Ukraine Launches Drones on Final Day of Russian Election",
  "summary": "Ukraine intensifies its drone attacks on Russia, targeting infrastructure and civilian areas while Moscow reports significant escalation in drone attacks and casualties. A drone strike on an industrial center in Tatarstan marks one of the deadliest attacks on Russian territory since the start of the war, with Russian officials reporting at least 75 injured and one death. The attack led to a day of mourning in Tatarstan as Ukrainian forces are accused of war crimes.",
