      "title": "Ukraine targets Moscow with hundreds of drones on final day of Russian election",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/20/hundreds-of-drones-target-moscow-on-last-day-of-voting-in-russias-parliamentary-election",
      "description": "<p>Doubts surround initial reports of ballistic missile use, with at least three killed and oil refinery damaged</p><p>Ukraine has targeted Moscow and the surrounding region in a large-scale attack that involved hundreds of drones.</p><p>The attack killed at least three people and damaged what Ukraine’s president, Volodymyr Zelenskyy, said was one of Russia’s “key oil industry facilities” on the <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/18/russia-parliament-election-duma-putin\">final day of the country’s parliamentary elections</a>, authorities said on Sunday.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/20/hundreds-of-drones-target-moscow-on-last-day-of-voting-in-russias-parliamentary-election\">Continue reading...</a>",
